Package: acstar
Title: Air-Conditioner Energy Star-Rating Classifier
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("daniel880830", email = "39270047+daniel880830@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Predicts the cooling energy-efficiency band (low / mid / high) of
    air conditioners from the Australian Energy Rating open dataset. Provides a
    reproducible cleaning pipeline, leakage-aware evaluation, a single
    preprocessing-plus-model artifact, a command line interface and a REST API.
